      "kind": "safety_property",
      "role": "guarantee",
      "statement": "The delivered program.vscore.json has the required canonical solve entry of arity 1 and admits only typed total deterministic pure-data execution within the restricted vscore/0.3 runtime, preserving input values, performing no external I/O and using no floating point. Arithmetic has unbounded mathematical integer semantics and the source has no external-effect constructors. S1 is explicitly source-only.",
      "required": true,
